{"unit_id":"zby1211__cordis-transfer-plugin#card-zh","repo":"zby1211/cordis-transfer-plugin","commit":"c99f767edbea444b12019bf934448983fb9d6327","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"cordis-transfer-plugin 是 DSH Web 的动态 Cordis Plugin 持久化工具。它在 Host 提供 agent 工具，并在 Settings → Plugins 加入浏览器面板，可列出当前会话插件、将选中的一个或多个插件导出为含清单的 ZIP，或从本地 ZIP 导入并选择是否激活。导入会按顺序重建插件版本，失败时回滚本批次。适合需要备份、迁移或分享动态插件的用户；需安装在启用 dynamicCordisRunner 的 cordis web profile，无需 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:42-67","index.js:220-297","index.js:317-343","index.js:514-565","client.js:253-327","package.json:20-32"]}
{"unit_id":"zby1211__cordis-transfer-plugin#card-en","repo":"zby1211/cordis-transfer-plugin","commit":"c99f767edbea444b12019bf934448983fb9d6327","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"cordis-transfer-plugin backs up dynamic Cordis Plugins in DSH Web. Host tools and a Settings panel list plugins, export selections as ZIP bundles, and import local bundles with optional activation. It restores package versions and rolls back a failed batch. Requires the cordis preset; no API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:42-67","index.js:220-297","index.js:317-343","index.js:514-565","client.js:253-327","package.json:20-32"]}
